  <data key="d1">"Entity Selection is a process or concept involved in choosing the correct entities within the OneStream System, critical for accurate functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection is the process involved in choosing the appropriate entity within the OneStream System, critical for ensuring correct system functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to a process or action where entities are chosen, potentially leading to errors if done incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing the correct entities within the OneStream system to ensure accurate reporting and data handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing the correct entities within the OneStream system, which can lead to errors if done incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to a process where users select specific entities within the OneStream system, which can lead to errors if incorrect choices are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing the correct entities within the OneStream system, which can lead to errors if done incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity selection is the process by which users choose between global or local entities in the dashboard for appropriate access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing specific entities in the OneStream system, which can lead to errors if done incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing specific entities within the OneStream system, which can lead to errors if done incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing the correct entities within the OneStream system, which can lead to errors if not done correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the selection process of entities within the OneStream system that can lead to errors if done incorrectly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing specific entities within the OneStream system to work with or analyze."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selection refers to the process of choosing specific entities within a system, which is highlighted as a potential source of error within the OneStream system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity selection is the process of choosing which organizational entity a user is associated with in the dashboard."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4c16dea3c9ee6681708eba0e92091faa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89b929c0b0394b7e9a26ac909ae2f1f</data>
