<node id="&quot;DELIVERY HERO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delivery Hero is a company involved in the selection process managed by EPG_Legal, which requires specific access permissions for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an entity involved in the issue discussed, likely as a company that provides food delivery services and relies on data accessibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company mentioned in connection with data access issues related to EPG_Legal and its user classifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company whose entities are managed by EPG_Legal and have specific access regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company that operates in the delivery sector, where legal selections determine user access to relevant data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company whose entities are presented by EPG_Legal, and it is relevant to data access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization whose entities are involved in the data access issues described in the context of EPG_Legal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company that is relevant to the data access issues being discussed, indicating its significant operational role."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company that is referenced in relation to data access and classification, with central users having specific access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an entity that presents various items but has restricted access to this information based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization that is involved in managing user access to data through the EPG_Legal selection system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization that has various entities, which are subjected to access restrictions based on central user privileges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company whose entities are involved in a selection process limited to central users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an entity that encompasses various operational aspects where data access is controlled by specific user classifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization referenced for its entities that are subject to access control based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company whose entities are involved in a selection process pertinent to the data access issues described."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization that provides delivery services, and its entities are referenced in the context of access limitations for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company whose entities are involved in the selection process managed by EPG_Legal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company referenced in relation to its entities and data accessibility issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization involved in the delivery service industry, and its entities are accessed by central users under specific classifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization that is impacted by the selection criteria of EPG_Legal, which restricts data access to central users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an entity that comprises various operations or entities accessed through EPG_Legal, indicating its presence in data selection processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company that is relevant in this context for its entities which have specific data access requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company that is central to the operations being described, with implications for data access based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company that operates in the delivery services industry and is relevant to the access protocols mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization whose entities are affected by the selection process of EPG_Legal, impacting user access to data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is an organization linked to the selection process mentioned in the text, where entities are presented for review and access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delivery Hero is a company referenced in the context of legal data access, indicating its role in providing delivery services."</data>
