<node id="&quot;ACCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Access is the permission or ability granted to the user to select and modify entities within the dashboard interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the ability of users to utilize the dashboard and its features, dependent on correct entity selection and account configurations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the ability or permission to use data and entities, which varies between central users and local users based on EPG_Legal’s criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the process or event of obtaining or being granted entry to relevant data, which is regulated by EPG_Legal guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the ability to view or present the data in the P&amp;L MPC report, which is restricted in this instance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the ability or permission to view and use data related to Delivery Hero's entities, which is restricted based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the ability or permission of the user to view specific data in the reporting system, which is being denied in this case."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the event of obtaining permission to use data, which is restricted based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the ability or permission to obtain or utilize the relevant data, constrained by the classification criteria of EPG_Legal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the action of entering or using the relevant data controlled by EPG_Legal and is restricted based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the process of obtaining permission to view or use data related to Delivery Hero."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the action of obtaining data from EPG_Legal, which is contingent on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the action of obtaining relevant data from Delivery Hero, which is dependent on user classification and EPG_Legal selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Access refers to the permissions and rights to view or utilize data managed by EPG_Legal within the context of Delivery Hero."</data>
