<node id="&quot;ENTITY SELECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entity Selector is a feature in a dashboard that allows users to choose and manage entities for data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selector is a feature in the dashboard that allows the user to choose and manage entities for data management purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selector is a feature on the dashboard that allows users to choose and change entities to view related data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity selector is a feature on the dashboard that allows the user to choose their own entity for access and functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selector is a tool within the dashboard that allows users to choose entities when working with data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector is a functional component within a dashboard that allows users to choose entities for data display."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity Selector is the component in the dashboard that allows users to select entities for data management and presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity Selector is a feature on the dashboard that allows users to choose entities to manage data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity selector is a tool within the dashboard that allows users to choose entities relevant to their access and tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity Selector is a feature located in the top-left of the dashboard that allows users to choose and manage entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector is a feature within the dashboard that allows users to choose and interact with entities for data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity Selector is a feature within the dashboard that allows users to select different entities for data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity Selector is a feature in the dashboard that allows users to choose and change their entities for data management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector is a feature in the dashboard that allows users to choose specific entities related to the data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector is a tool within the dashboard used to change and select entities relevant