<node id="&quot;DASHBOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dashboard is a feature within OneStream where reports, including the P&amp;L MPC report, are intended to be presented visually for user access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is a software interface used for managing entity selection and viewing information related to user access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard refers to the interface where the user interacts with the entity selections and data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is an event that represents the interface where users can view and manage entity settings and reports."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a digital interface that allows users to visualize and manipulate data by interacting with various features including the Entity Selector."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is the interface where users can select entities and view data presentations based on their selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard refers to a digital interface where users can interact with various organizational entities and their settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard refers to the user interface where entity selection and network performance monitoring occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a digital interface where users interact with the Entity selector and view data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a digital interface where users interact with the entity selector and view data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is a user interface location where entity selection and performance issues are monitored and managed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is an interface where users can view and interact with data presentations and entity selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is the interface where changes are made, and data presentations are displayed after updates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is the interface where users can select entities, manage permissions, and monitor system performance and errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a digital interface where users select entities and manage their settings, including access and performance issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a user interface where the entity selector and data presentation occur, allowing user interaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a digital interface where users can view and interact with data presentations related to selected entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a tool used for monitoring and selecting entities, and it requires proper configuration to function correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is the digital interface where users make selections and view data presentations related to entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is an interface where users can manage entity selections and perform various tasks related to their account."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is an interface tool that allows users to select entities and refresh data for better visualization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is the user interface where entity selection is made and network performance can be assessed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is an interface where users can select entities and manage access to features like network performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard represents the interface where users view and interact with data and entity selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a digital interface used for managing entity selections and monitoring access."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a digital interface where users can interact with the Entity selector to manage and view data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is a user interface that provides access to various entities and operational settings, indicating where configuration changes can be made."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a user interface where the entity selector is located and where changes to entities are applied and data presented."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is the interface where the User interacts with the Entity selector and views data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard serves as an interface for managing entities and monitoring system performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a user interface where entity selections are made and monitored for access issues in the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is the interface where users solve issues related to data presentation and entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard refers to the user interface used to interact with various entities and monitor system performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard represents the interface where users interact with the entity selector and view data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard refers to the user interface where entities and their statuses can be managed and viewed within the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a user interface where users can select entities and see data presentations, critical for accessing information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is the interface that displays data and allows users to select entities for viewing related information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is an interface where users can select entities and view their status and configurations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard refers to the user interface that displays various entity selections and performance metrics for organizational management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a digital interface used by users to select entities and view data presentations related to those entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a user interface that allows interaction with various entities and data presentations for decision-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a platform interface where users interact with entities and manage their access settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is a user interface that displays data presentation and allows users to interact with different entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard serves as the user interface where the entity selector is located and provides access to various features."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is a user interface that displays information and tools for users to manage their entities and view system performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a digital interface where users can select entities and view related data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a digital interface that users interact with to manage their entities and monitor various system functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is an interactive platform where users can select entities and view related data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dashboard is described as a tool where users can select entities and view data presentation, serving as an interface for interaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is a user interface that allows users to monitor and interact with the system's functionalities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a user interface where entity selection and network performance issues are monitored and addressed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is the user interface where users select entities and refresh data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Dashboard is a digital interface where users can interact with the Entity Selector to view data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The dashboard is an interface where users can access and manage entity selections and network performance issues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-de22530deea07aed27df7f24440a6b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89b929c0b0394b7e9a26ac909ae2f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff29e8a6836503d6ce44b763aa795c9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DATA PRESENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Data Presentation describes the visualization and display of information within the cells based on user-selected entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation is the result of selecting an entity and refreshing the dashboard, allowing the user to view relevant information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation refers to the visual display of data that users can view after selecting the appropriate entities and refreshing the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the visualization or display of data related to the selected entity on the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation describes the display of information that results from the user's interactions with the entity selection process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the visualization of information in the related cells of the dashboard after entity selection and changes have been applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation refers to the visual representation of information that appears in the cells after the user selects and refreshes the entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the display of data in the selected cells after the appropriate entity has been chosen and changes applied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation refers to the display and organization of information within the dashboard after entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation represents the display of information in the dashboard after the user has selected an appropriate entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation refers to the outcome of selecting an entity and refreshing the dashboard, resulting in the display of related information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the visualization of information within the dashboard, as influenced by user selections and updates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the outcome of successfully communicating and displaying data in cells of an Excel workbook as per system requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the visual display of data derived from the selected entities, aimed at providing insights or reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Presentation refers to the visualization of data in the dashboard after the user selects an entity and refreshes the interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation is the outcome displayed in the dashboard after the user selects entities and applies changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data presentation refers to the method of displaying data in Excel, which can be affected by the alignment issues discussed in the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1aafc09ea3e8bdeaef865afda9540497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff29e8a6836503d6ce44b763aa795c9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENTITY EXTRACTION PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Entity Extraction Process is a method by which entities such as organizations, people, locations, and events are identified from a text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEXT DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Text document refers to a written or printed piece of content that can contain various forms of information and concepts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Text Document refers to the written material from which entities are extracted, playing a central role in the entity identification activity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACTIVITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Activity refers to the specific tasks or processes involved in identifying entities and their relationships from the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Activity signifies actions or processes that occur within a specific setting or narrative."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OUTPUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Output refers to the final results displaying extracted entities and relationships, formatted for clarity and comprehension."&lt;SEP&gt;"output refers to the result or information produced from a process, typically in response to a request or inquiry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IDENTIFIED ENTITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Identified Entities is a term used to describe the specific entities that have been correctly recognized in the extraction process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATIONSHIPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relationships describe the associations or connections between the identified entities, providing context to their interactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEP 1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Step 1 refers to the initial phase in the extraction process where entities are identified and categorized."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEP 2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Step 2 refers to the phase in the extraction process where relationships between the identified entities are established."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STEP 3&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Step 3 refers to the phase where overarching themes and keywords are derived from the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINAL OUTPUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Final Output is the comprehensive compilation of entities, relationships, and content keywords formatted for review."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENGLISH LANGUAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"English Language is the medium of communication used in the provided text and entity identification tasks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORMATTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Formatting refers to the presentation of data, including elements like leading zeros, spaces, and letter case, which can impact data comparison and validation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Formatting refers to the way in which extracted entities and relationships are presented to ensure clarity and adherence to specified guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c686046d60abc94ecd48dc9fcb9279e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"List denotes the set of entities and relationships created as a result of the extraction process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Processing involves the analysis and categorization of information from text to derive meaningful outputs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Natural Language Processing refers to the field of artificial intelligence involved in understanding and extracting information from human language."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AI TOOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AI Tools are technological solutions that assist in the extraction and analysis of entities from text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COGNITIVE ANALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
