  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLARIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clarification is the process of ensuring that the outputs meet the required specifications and are easy to understand."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVALUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Evaluation describes the assessment of the entity extraction process to determine its effectiveness and accuracy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEEDBACK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Feedback refers to the comments or evaluations provided to improve the entity extraction process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ITERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Iteration is the repeated process of refining the entity extraction method based on evaluation and feedback."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESULTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Results denote the outcomes of the entity extraction process, typically presented in a report or summary format."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEANING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Meaning represents the significance or implications of the identified entities and their relationships within the context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERSTANDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Understanding refers to the comprehension of the relationships and significance of entities extracted from the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTERPRETATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interpretation involves analyzing the results of the extraction to derive conclusions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXPLORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exploration pertains to the in-depth examination of text to uncover hidden entities and connections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;KNOWLEDGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Knowledge encompasses the information and insights gained from the entity extraction process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUMMARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Summary is a concise overview that captures the essence of the entities and relationships identified."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Findings refer to the discoveries made during the entity extraction process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPILATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Compilation is the process of gathering all identified entities and relationships into a cohesive output."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENTITY TYPES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Entity Types define the categories into which identified entities are organized, such as organization, person, location, and event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relevance indicates how pertinent the extracted entities are in relation to the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Relevance is a measure of how pertinent or applicable information or entities are to a particular context or task."&lt;SEP&gt;"Relevance indicates the importance or applicability of a particular piece of information in a given context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insights are the deeper understandings derived after analyzing the relationships between identified entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEGRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Integration is the incorporation of identified entities and relationships into a structured format for output."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEXT ANALYSIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Text Analysis refers to the method of examining and interpreting text to identify meanings and patterns."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLARITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clarity ensures that outputs are understandable and accurately reflect the extracted information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPRESENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Representation concerns how extracted entities and relationships are visually or structurally presented."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISTINCT ELEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Distinct Elements refer to individual, identifiable parts or units within the text that are categorized as entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IDENTIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Identification encompasses the action of recognizing and naming entities within a text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ATTRIBUTES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Attributes are characteristics or features associated with each identified entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Attributes are distinctive features or characteristics that define or describe various entities in a given context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Governance relates to the management and oversight of the entity extraction process and its outcomes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FRAMEWORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Framework provides the structure or system within which entity extraction and analysis takes place."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLETENESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Completeness refers to the thoroughness of the entity extraction process in capturing all relevant information."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNIFICANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Significance pertains to the importance of identified entities and their relationships within the overarching context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b5a7adde1af5c87d7fd797b6245c2a39</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MISSING DATA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Missing Data indicates a potential explanation for the issues faced when the wrong entity is selected, impacting user experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing Data indicates a situation where expected information is absent due to potential issues with entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing data pertains to instances when necessary information is not available in the system, potentially leading to errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing data refers to the information that appears to be absent when the wrong entity is selected, which can complicate user experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing data refers to a situation where necessary information is not available, leading to confusion in the selection process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing data refers to the absence of expected information within the system, which can lead to confusion during entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing Data indicates a problem that arises when necessary information is not available in the system, often tied to entity selection errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing data indicates a failure in providing required information, potentially leading to user confusion or errors during operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing Data refers to the absence of information that could be a result of incorrect entity selection within the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Missing Data indicates an issue where necessary information is not available in the System, potentially leading to confusion for Users."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6d67c1dc051ea34b153886bca7e68844</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CELLS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cells are the individual components where related data is displayed following the adjustments made through the Entity Selector."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells in the dashboard refer to the specific areas where data is presented after entity selections are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to sections within the dashboard where data presentations are displayed after an entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to specific areas within the dashboard where data is presented to the user after making selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to specific areas within the dashboard where data related to selected entities is presented."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the individual compartments within the dashboard where data is presented and viewed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the individual segments in the dashboard where data presentation occurs, highlighting the organization of the displayed information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the areas within the dashboard where related data is presented based on the user's selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells in this context refer to the individual segments in the report presentation that are failing to display data as expected."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to specific areas within the dashboard where data presentations are displayed based on user selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cells refer to specific locations or sections within the dashboard where data presentations are displayed based on the selected entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells are the specific sections of the dashboard where data presentation occurs after selecting an entity and refreshing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the individual components in the dashboard where data presentations are displayed and organized based on selected entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells are the individual units in a spreadsheet where data is input, processed, and displayed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the individual data boxes within an Excel spreadsheet where specific information is entered or displayed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the specific areas within the dashboard where the data presentation occurs, related to the selected entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to individual units within the dashboard where data presentation occurs after entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cells refer to the individual boxes in an Excel spreadsheet where data is entered or presented, highlighting their role in data organization."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-de22530deea07aed27df7f24440a6b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1aafc09ea3e8bdeaef865afda9540497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff29e8a6836503d6ce44b763aa795c9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED ENTITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A related entity is a specific entity that has connections or associations with other entities, indicated by user selection in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Entity is a designation used to refer to the entity that the user selects in relation to their own entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"A related entity is an entity linked to the one selected by the user, presenting relevant information in the dashboard."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9ff29e8a6836503d6ce44b763aa795c9</data>
</node>
