<node id="&quot;LOCAL ADMIN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Local Admin is a person responsible for managing user accounts and ensuring correct entity assignments in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin is an individual responsible for managing user accounts and access within the organizational entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin refers to an individual responsible for managing account access and settings for users within a local entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin refers to the individual responsible for managing access and entity selection for users in their local area."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local admin is an individual responsible for administering user accounts and ensuring correct entity assignments in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin is the individual responsible for managing user accounts and permissions at the local level, ensuring correct access to entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is responsible for managing user accounts and ensuring correct entity assignments within the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is an individual responsible for ensuring account assignments and access to entities within the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is an individual responsible for managing user account settings and entity selections in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is a person responsible for ensuring user accounts are correctly assigned to their respective entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is responsible for ensuring that user accounts are assigned to the correct entity and resolving access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin is an individual responsible for managing user access and account assignments related to the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is an individual responsible for ensuring account access and proper entity assignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Admin is responsible for confirming user account assignments to the correct entities and assisting in resolving access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin refers to an individual responsible for managing access permissions and settings related to the entity dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin likely refers to an individual responsible for managing access and entity assignments within a local environment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Admin is a person responsible for managing account access and ensuring correct entity assignments for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local admin is a person responsible for ensuring users' accounts are assigned to the correct local entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is indicated as a person responsible for ensuring users have the correct account assignments to entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin refers to the person responsible for managing user accounts and permissions related to the entity selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Admin refers to an individual's role responsible for managing user access and account assignments within an organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin is an individual responsible for ensuring that users have access and proper assignments to entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Admin is an individual responsible for ensuring that user accounts are assigned to the correct entity and managing permissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local admin refers to an individual responsible for ensuring user accounts are correctly assigned to entities."</data>
