<node id="&quot;VPN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a service that creates a secure connection over the internet, which can affect internet speed and, consequently, application performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a service that creates a secure connection over the internet, which can affect internet speed and stability for cloud-based applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a service that encrypts your internet connection, which may affect the speed and stability of data transfers in applications like OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a technology that creates a secure network connection over the internet, which can affect the stability of data transfer in OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN, or Virtual Private Network, serves as a secure connection over the internet, but can cause slower connections impacting OneStream's performance."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a technology that creates a secure connection over the internet, which can affect OneStream's performance if slow."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN stands for Virtual Private Network, a technology that can affect the speed and stability of internet connections used by OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a technology that can slow down internet connections, impacting the performance of cloud-based applications like OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN, or Virtual Private Network, is a technology used to create a secure connection over the internet, but a slow VPN can hinder data transfer in cloud applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN, or Virtual Private Network, is a technology used to create a secure connection over the internet, which can impact the data transfer speed and stability for applications like OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN, or Virtual Private Network, is a technology that creates a secure connection over a less secure network, such as the internet. It can affect the performance of applications dependent on internet stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a secure connection method that may slow down internet access, impacting applications like OneStream during data transfer."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN, or Virtual Private Network, is a technology that creates a secure connection over the internet, which can affect the speed and stability of online applications if not functioning optimally."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) technology provides a secure and private connection to the internet, which can impact internet speed and stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a technology that creates a secure connection over the internet, but can impact connection speed and stability for cloud applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a service that creates a secure connection over the internet, potentially affecting data transfer speeds when unstable."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a technology used to enhance security and privacy during internet usage, but can affect internet speeds affecting applications like OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a service that encrypts your internet connection and can affect the performance of applications like OneStream when used on slow networks."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN (Virtual Private Network) is a technology that helps secure internet connections, which may affect the speed and reliability of OneStream data transfers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A VPN, or Virtual Private Network, is used to secure internet connections; however, using a slow VPN can hinder OneStream's performance during file transfers."&lt;SEP&gt;"VPN, or Virtual Private Network, provides a secure connection over the internet and can impact internet speed and stability, affecting applications like OneStream."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8af938d88e1d92c810317b41dd75f14f</data>
</node>
