<node id="&quot;FILE TRANSFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"File Transfer describes the process of moving files between systems, which is critical in the context of using OneStream and can be disrupted by connectivity issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"File Transfer is the process through which data is moved from one location to another, a primary function of OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is an event that involves moving data from one location to another, which is essential for the operation of OneStream and is susceptible to connection issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of moving files from one location to another over a network, which OneStream performs and relies on stable connections."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of moving files from one system to another, which can be disrupted by connectivity issues in applications like OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of copying or moving a file from one location to another, a primary function of OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is an event that can be disrupted due to connection issues, leading to potential failures in OneStream's operation."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of moving files from one location to another, which can be affected by the quality of the internet connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of transmitting files from one system to another over a network, which can be impacted by connection stability and speed."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of moving files from one location to another through a network, integral to OneStream's functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of moving files from one location to another over a network, which is central to OneStream's functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of transmitting a computer file from one host to another over a network, which is affected by the stability of the internet connection in the case of OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"File transfer is the process of moving files from one location to another over 