<node id="&quot;DATA IMPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Data Import is an event where users attempt to load or integrate files into the OneStream system, which may lead to errors if connectivity is poor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Import is the process by which users bring data into the OneStream system, which can encounter errors during validation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Import is the process by which users bring data into the OneStream system, which can encounter errors if the setup is incorrect or connectivity is poor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Import refers to the process of transferring data from a source into the OneStream platform, which must comply with specific validation rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Import is the process of transferring data into the OneStream System, which can be affected by errors or system messages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data import is the process of transferring data into the OneStream System from external files, which can encounter errors if connectivity issues arise."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data import is an event that occurs when users attempt to load data into the OneStream system, essential for functionality."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Import refers to the process of transferring data into the OneStream system, which can be affected by network performance issues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e16b8771a1ab8fe5a7c40a0d7f824295&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-535f01724a527eb2a222ccf841fb81bf</data>
