<node id="&quot;DATA VALIDATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Data Validation is the process of checking the accuracy and quality of data being imported into the OneStream system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Validation is the process that users perform to ensure data integrity within the OneStream system, which can sometimes flag errors or issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data Validation refers to the process of ensuring that imported data meets certain criteria and can lead to error messages if issues arise."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data validation is an event where the system checks the correctness and integrity of the data during importing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-535f01724a527eb2a222ccf841fb81bf</data>
