  <data key="d1">"A slow VPN can hinder the performance of cloud-based applications by reducing internet speed, which affects data transfer capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"A slow VPN is a type of internet connection that may cause delays and interruptions, impacting the functionality of applications that rely on data transfer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Slow VPN refers to a Virtual Private Network that hampers internet speed, impacting the performance of applications like OneStream during file transfers."</data>
