  <data key="d1">"Authentication Error is an event where users encounter issues while trying to access OneStream through Okta, resulting in a message that access is denied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Authentication Error refers to the issue users encounter when attempting to log into OneStream, leading to an 'Access Denied' message."&lt;SEP&gt;"Authentication Error refers to the problem users encounter when they are redirected to Okta and cannot successfully log into OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"Authentication Error refers to the issue users encounter when trying to log into OneStream and are denied access due to Okta's failure."</data>
