</node>
<node id="&quot;ERROR HANDLING &amp; MAPPING GUIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Error Handling &amp; Mapping Guide is an event that pertains to managing and mapping system errors within OneStream framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Handling &amp; Mapping Guide is a document provided by OneStream that outlines procedures and solutions for managing system errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Handling &amp; Mapping Guide is a document that outlines procedures for dealing with system errors and incorrect entity selections within the OneStream system."</data>
