<node id="&quot;RELATED CELLS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Related Cells are parts of the dashboard where data presentation occurs based on user selections from the Entity Selector."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Cells are sections of the dashboard where data presentation is shown after the user makes selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Cells are specific areas within the dashboard where the data appears after the user chooses and refreshes the corresponding entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Cells refer to specific areas within the dashboard where data presentations are shown after selections are made by the user."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related cells refer to parts of the dashboard where data presentation occurs after selecting an entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related cells refer to the parts of the dashboard where data associated with the chosen entity is presented."</data>
