</node>
<node id="&quot;NO ACCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"No Access is a situation indicating that a user cannot enter or utilize certain functionalities of the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is a status indicating that data presentation is restricted, affecting the visibility of the P&amp;L MPC report."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is an error event indicating that a user does not have the necessary permissions to access certain features of the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is an event that users may experience when their accounts are not correctly set up with the appropriate entity selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access refers to an error state that occurs when a user does not have the necessary permissions to access a specific entity or resource."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access refers to the error message encountered when users do not have the correct permissions or configurations to access the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is an error message that indicates the user does not have the necessary permissions to access certain entities within the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is the error highlighted in the report, indicating that data cannot be presented due to permission issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is a status indicating that the user does not have permission to view or present the data in the report, representing a barrier to information."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is an event indicating that a user cannot access certain features or data due to insufficient permissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Access is an error message indicating that the user is unable to access certain data within the P&amp;L MPC report presentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-de22530deea07aed27df7f24440a6b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b89b929c0b0394b7e9a26ac909ae2f1f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IMPORT OR VALIDATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Import or Validation are processes related to data handling in OneStream that may be hindered by connection issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Import or Validation refers to the processes involved in transferring data into a system and verifying its accuracy or integrity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Import or Validation is an action taken within the OneStream system that may fail due to connectivity issues or system errors."</data>
