<node id="&quot;IT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IT is a department responsible for managing credentials and group assignments within an organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for checking Okta profiles, resetting credentials, and updating group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for managing system access, credential resets, and group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for managing technical support, including checking Okta profiles and resetting credentials."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT refers to the Information Technology department responsible for managing user profiles and assisting with login issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the organization responsible for managing user profiles, credentials, and group assignments related to system access."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the organization responsible for checking Okta profiles and managing credential resets and group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT refers to the information technology department responsible for managing user profiles and credentials within the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the technical department responsible for managing systems and user access, including credential resets and group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for managing user authentication and access, including resetting credentials and updating group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is responsible for managing user credentials and group assignments in the context of software access and validation."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for checking Okta profiles, resetting credentials, and updating group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the organization responsible for managing account profiles and resolving issues related to login credentials and group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for managing technology and user access, indicated by its role in checking profiles and resetting credentials."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for checking Okta profiles, resetting credentials, and updating group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the department responsible for checking Okta profiles and managing credentials and group assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the organization responsible for managing user credentials and group assignments, ensuring users can access the necessary systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT is the organizational unit responsible for managing technical support, including credential resets and group assignments within an organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT refers to the Information Technology department, which handles technical issues and support related to the company's systems, including time synchronization problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT refers to the Information Technology department responsible for managing technology-related services and support."&lt;SEP&gt;"IT refers to the Information Technology department responsible for managing the company's technology and addressing technical issues."</data>
