<node id="&quot;MAPPING ERROR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mapping Error describes an error that occurs when there are incorrect combinations of dimensions in data processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error indicates a specific issue encountered when the data is incorrectly mapped, leading to validation failure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to a situation where the mapping of values fails, causing validation problems in the OneStream system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping error refers to an issue where the software cannot link a value from the source file to a corresponding entity in the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to an issue that arises when there is a failure to map a dimension value correctly within OneStream, often due to unaddressed accounts or dimensions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error specifies the type of validation error that occurs when data structures do not correspond correctly during processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to a specific type of Validation Error that is caused by incorrectly configured data mappings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mapping Error is a specific type of issue encountered during the login process, likely resulting from configuration problems with user accounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error specifically highlights an issue that arises when data cannot be accurately matched or aligned as intended."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error indicates a specific type of validation error that occurs when data does not align correctly with the intended structure or format."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to an issue encountered during data validation where the system cannot map a value from a source file to a valid OneStream member."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mapping Error indicates a specific type of problem related to user access, suggesting issues with user account settings or permissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to an issue encountered during the validation process in OneStream where the system fails to map values correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to the issue encountered during a validation process when the expected mapping does not align with the existing data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error is a specific issue that arises during the login process, indicating a failure in user or credential mapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to a failure that occurs when a system cannot correctly translate or link data points, indicating a problem in the data workflow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping error occurs when the required dimension combinations are not correctly set, leading to rejection of entries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error is an event that signals the absence of a valid link between a value in the source file and OneStream members, often leading to validation issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to a validation error that occurs when data does not conform to expected formatting or criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error is a specific type of error encountered during the login process that indicates an issue with user credentials or settings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to a validation issue that arises when the mapping of files does not correspond to the expected format or guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error is an event in OneStream that indicates a problem with data integration and value mapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to an event in the validation process where incorrect combinations or required dimensions lead to errors that need resolution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error is an issue that occurs when the data mapping does not align with the anticipated format or guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error is an event that occurs when there is a discrepancy in data, leading to validation failures that require addressing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to a specific type of validation error that occurs during the process of data mapping, requiring adjustments for resolution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mapping Error refers to the event in which the system fails to map values correctly from the source file to a valid OneStream member."</data>
