  <data key="d1">"Changes denote the modifications made by the user when selecting different entities, which subsequently affect data visualizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Changes pertain to the modifications made by the user in the Entity selector that impact the data displayed in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Changes refer to the updates or selections made by the user in the Entity selector that affect data visibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Changes refer to the modifications made by the user when selecting entities within the dashboard that require application."&lt;SEP&gt;"Changes refer to the adjustments made by the user in selecting entities and refreshing the dashboard for updated data presentation."</data>
