<node id="&quot;OKTA PROFILE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Okta Profile refers to a user profile that IT checks for credential management and access permissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Okta Profile is related to user authentication and authorization, which may need to be checked or reset as part of the login error process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Okta Profile represents a digital identity management system where user credentials and group assignments are managed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Okta profile refers to the user account associated with authentication, which IT may modify during troubleshooting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Okta profile is related to user authentication and may require updates if there are login issues."</data>
