<node id="&quot;VALIDATION FAILURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Validation Failures occur when discrepancies arise in mapped data, preventing successful integration between systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Validation Failures occur when the data does not match or cannot be successfully integrated due to discrepancies in formatting or missing mappings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Validation failures occur when data discrepancies prevent successful mapping between systems, leading to errors during workflows."&lt;SEP&gt;"Validation Failures occur when there are mismatches in data due to variations in formatting or missing entries, impacting the financial reconciliation process."</data>
