  <data key="d1">"A file in this context contains the data related to user-defined members, which, if incorrect, can cause validation failures in OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"A file refers to a digital document or dataset that users attempt to import into the OneStream system, which may generate errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or dataset that may require adjustments or fixes in order to validate properly."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or input that is being processed and may need adjustments based on validation criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or record that is being processed and may require adjustments for proper mapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or resource that needs to be adjusted or corrected for proper use within a workflow."&lt;SEP&gt;"File represents the data file that is being processed and may require adjustments related to mapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or set of data that may require mapping adjustments to function correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The file refers to a digital document or dataset that is subject to validation and potential mapping corrections."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or data format that may be subject to validation and mapping checks in a workflow process."&lt;SEP&gt;"File is an organizational element that contains data, which may need adjustment when errors are encountered in the mapping process."&lt;SEP&gt;"File represents a collection of data that is being processed and may require adjustments to correct validation errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document or record that is being processed and may require adjustments or corrections for proper mapping."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to the data file that is used in the mapping process, which must adhere to specific user-defined rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"File refers to a digital document that may require mapping adjustments or validation in workflows."&lt;SEP&gt;"The file refers