ce data refers to the original information or account that is being processed or integrated into the OneStream platform."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source Data refers to the original information being processed by OneStream, which might contain values that need to be mapped correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source data refers to original data that is imported into OneStream for processing, which must comply with the data model."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source Data refers to the original data that is imported into OneStream for processing and analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source data denotes the underlying data that feeds into OneStream for mapping and reporting processes, which may sometimes include new or unrecognized items."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source data refers to the original data from which accounts or items are derived and mapped in OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source data refers to the original data imported into OneStream that undergoes validation and processing for accurate reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source Data refers to the original data from which OneStream retrieves information for mapping and analysis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source data refers to the original information imported into OneStream that needs to be mapped correctly according to its data model."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source Data refers to the original data or documents that provide the basis for subsequent data entry or report generation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Source data refers to the original data or input used in the context of mapping and reporting within OneStream."</data>
