  <data key="d1">"User-Defined Members (UD) are customized elements in OneStream accounts that dictate access and rules for specific users, influencing how data is mapped and validated."&lt;SEP&gt;"User-Defined Members (UD) refer to the customizable members that can be configured within OneStream accounts, influencing data validation rules and mappings."&lt;SEP&gt;"User-defined members refer to customizable elements within OneStream accounts that determine which values are valid for mapping and validation processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"User-defined members (UD) refer to specific individuals or elements defined by users in OneStream that have roles or permissions within account management."</data>
