ted to OneStream's functionalities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The OS team is responsible for overseeing checks and transformations in the OneStream system, ensuring proper functionality and validation."&lt;SEP&gt;"OS team refers to a team associated with the OneStream organization that assists with handling validation issues and transformation rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"The OS team is an organization responsible for overseeing the transformation and validation processes in the context of a particular system."</data>
