  <data key="d1">"Data cells refer to individual elements or units of data within the OneStream system that can be queried or logged."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data cells refer to storage units within the OneStream system where data is supposed to be pulled from or managed, which can sometimes lead to complications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Data cells refer to the specific XFGetCell data cells that may not be functioning properly or being pulled into the OneStream system."</data>
