  <data key="d1">"Secure Authentication Tokens are time-sensitive elements that authenticate login processes for OneStream's systems."&lt;SEP&gt;"Secure authentication tokens are time-sensitive elements used by OneStream that require synchronization with server time to be valid for user login."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a57c6b9afbd15940a292bd5d99564c9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTOMATIC TIME UPDATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Automatic Time Updates are a feature that, when enabled, allows the local computer to synchronize its clock with the server time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Automatic time updates are a feature that allows a computer to synchronize its system clock with standard time servers, preventing synchronization issues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a57c6b9afbd15940a292bd5d99564c9</data>
</node>
