  <data key="d3">393.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Okta facilitates user access to OneStream, indicating a dependency relationship between the two organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Okta is integral to the authentication process when users attempt to access OneStream, indicating a dependency on Okta for user login."&lt;SEP&gt;"Okta provides authentication services that OneStream relies on for user login, indicating a direct dependency between the two organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Okta provides authentication services that support users trying to log into OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, indicating a dependency in the login process."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream utilizes Okta for user authentication; however, integration issues may cause login failures."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication services, and issues arise during the login process due to integration between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream uses Okta for authentication during the login process, indicating a dependency on Okta's services for user access."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication services during the user login process."&lt;&lt;"authentication, dependency"&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication during the login process, indicating a direct operational dependency."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication during login, indicating their operational interdependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream uses Okta for user authentication, which is essential for access to the platform.""&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication, but faces issues that prevent successful logins."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream users may be redirected to Okta during the login process, highlighting a functional relationship between the two organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, which can lead to access issues if failures occur with Okta's service."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream requires users to log in via Okta, making the latter essential for access to the platform."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, which is critical for accessing their system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users logging into OneStream are redirected to Okta, indicating a link between the two platforms in terms of user authentication."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream users are redirected to Okta for authentication, linking the two organizations in the user login process."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream's login system depends on Okta's authentication services, which can lead to access errors for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, leading to login errors that affect user access to OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream utilizes Okta for authentication during the login process, which is critical for user access."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for its authentication process, which is leading to user access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users attempting to log into OneStream are redirected to Okta, indicating a process link between the two organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, which may lead to access denial errors for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users logging into OneStream are redirected to Okta, which is part of the authentication process for accessing OneStream."."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication services, leading to users encountering errors during login."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream users may be redirected to Okta for authentication, which can result in access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication services, which impacts user access to the OneStream system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users attempting to log into OneStream are redirected to Okta for authentication purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users of OneStream are redirected to Okta for authentication during the login process, indicating a direct relationship regarding user access."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication services, and issues with Okta can impede access to OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, which may lead to errors like 'Access Denied' during login attempts."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication purposes, and any error from Okta directly impacts user access to OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication during the login process, which may lead to access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Okta authentication error is related to issues within the OneStream system, suggesting a connection between user access and organizational operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, and issues in Okta affect the access to OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users attempt to log into OneStream and may be redirected to Okta for authentication, indicating a dependency between the two platforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, and errors in Okta affect access to OneStream."&lt;&lt;"authentication, reliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream users may be redirected to Okta for authentication during their login attempt."&lt;SEP&gt;"Okta's authentication errors directly affect users trying to log into OneStream, causing access issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, making it essential for access to the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream users are redirected to Okta for login, which is essential for accessing the platform but may lead to errors."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream encounters login issues that are related to the authentication processes managed by Okta."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for authentication, making it crucial in the login process for users attempting to access OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream relies on Okta for user authentication, indicating a dependency on the Okta service for access control."&lt;SEP&gt;"OneStream users log in through Okta, making Okta integral to accessing the OneStream application."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users may be redirected to Okta during the login process for OneStream, indicating a dependency on Okta for authenticat