<edge source="&quot;EPG_LEGAL&quot;" target="&quot;P&amp;L MPC REPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d3">157.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"EPG_Legal as a user-selected local entity affects the presentation of the P&amp;L MPC Report due to access constraints."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is a local entity affecting the user's access to the P&amp;L MPC report, relating to the context of data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user from EPG_Legal attempting to access the P&amp;L MPC Report is related to the issue of 'No Access' due to their locality within OneStream’s structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selected EPG_Legal, a local entity, which is causing the access issue for the P&amp;L MPC report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selection of EPG_Legal impacts the accessibility of the P&amp;L MPC report in OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user's selection of EPG_Legal under the entity selection bar affects the access to the P&amp;L MPC report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user's selection of EPG_Legal impacts their ability to access the P&amp;L MPC report, indicating a relationship based on location-based access rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"The issue with the P&amp;L MPC report arises because the user belongs to EPG_Legal, indicating a relationship between user location and reporting access."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local entity EPG_Legal is relevant to the P&amp;L MPC report as users from this entity face access denial, affecting their ability to view the report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The issue with the P&amp;L MPC report is directly related to the selection of EPG_Legal by the user, affecting access to the report data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The issue with the P&amp;L MPC report arises because the user is associated with EPG_Legal, affecting their access to the report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The access issue for the P&amp;L MPC report occurs because the associated user is tied to the local entity EPG_Legal."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is connected to the P&amp;L MPC report issue because the user selecting this local entity is causing access issues for the report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user has selected EPG_Legal in relation to the P&amp;L MPC report, indicating a connection between entity selection and report presentation issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selected EPG_Legal in the entity selection bar, which relates to the access issues encountered with the P&amp;L MPC report presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local entity EPG_Legal chosen by the user is relevant to the access issues experienced in the P&amp;L MPC report presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local entity EPG_Legal is affecting the accessibility of the P&amp;L MPC report due to user selection limitations."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's selection affects the access to the P&amp;L MPC report presentation, indicating a relationship between user entity choice and report accessibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is related to the user selection that affects the access to the P&amp;L MPC report presentation, indicating a user-specific limitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user associated with EPG_Legal faces access issues when attempting to present the P&amp;L MPC report, linking local entity selection with reporting problems."&lt;SEP&gt;"The selection of EPG_Legal by the user affects their access to the P&amp;L MPC Report, indicating a reliance on local entities for data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The selection of EPG_Legal under the entity selection bar is causing access issues for the P&amp;L MPC report, affecting its presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selected EPG_Legal, which is a local entity that affects the access to the P&amp;L MPC Report being presented."</data>
  <data key="d5">"access control, entity selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"access control, report presentation issue"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, entity dependency"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, entity selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, local entity"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, locality"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, organizational structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, user limitation"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, user location"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issue, user selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issues, entity selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issues, local entity"&lt;SEP&gt;"access issues, location-based restrictions"&lt;SEP&gt;"access, user impact"&lt;SEP&gt;"data access, local entity influence"&lt;SEP&gt;"data access, selection impact"&lt;SEP&gt;"local entity, access issues"&lt;SEP&gt;"user access, entity selection"&lt;SEP&gt;"user access, report access"&lt;SEP&gt;"user access, reporting issue"</data>
