</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EPG_LEGAL&quot;" target="&quot;CENTRAL ENTITY&quot;">
  <data key="d3">83.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Central Entity conceptually differs from EPG_Legal as it represents a broader level of entity that may encompass it."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is mentioned as a selection option within a dropdown menu related to user entities, indicating its function in the selection process."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal represents a specific choice in the entity selection process, contrasting with the central entity notion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The central entity is contrasted with EPG_Legal, indicating a misalignment in user selection affecting access."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is positioned as an option under the entity selection bar that pertains to the central entity's overall framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central entity represents the broader organizational structure that contrasts with local entities like EPG_Legal, influencing user access."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is mentioned in conjunction with the central entity, illustrating a potential selection issue related to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is a specific organization that users can choose from in contrast to the central entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship emphasizes the difference in access permissions between the central entity and the local entity EPG_Legal."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is involved in a selection process that may relate to the Central Entity, showing interactions between different organizational levels."&lt;SEP&gt;"The central entity is contrasted with EPG_Legal based on user selection in a dropdown menu, reflecting different operational contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is part of the larger organizational structure represented by the Central Entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The central entity and EPG_Legal are related as they provide different user access points in OneStream for reports."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user is based in a local entity (EPG_Legal) rather than the central entity, directly impacting their access to the report."</data>
  <data key="d5">"access permissions, organizational hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"entity interaction, organizational hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"entity selection, access dynamics"&lt;SEP&gt;"entity selection, operational context"&lt;SEP&gt;"entity selection, organizational distinction"&lt;SEP&gt;"entity selection, organizational framework"&lt;SEP&gt;"entity selection, user interface"&lt;SEP&gt;"hierarchical structure, organizational context"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational hierarchy, selection issue"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational membership, structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure, access hierarchy"&lt;SEP&gt;"organizational structure, access impacts"&lt;SEP&gt;"selection process, organizational type"&lt;SEP&gt;"system interaction, organizational hierarchy"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de22530deea07aed27df7f24440a6b85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d67c1dc051ea34b153886bca7e68844</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EPG_LEGAL&quot;" target="&quot;USER&quot;">
  <data key="d3">242.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The User can select EPG_Legal as an option from the Entity selector when managing entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User can select EPG_Legal from the Entity selector to view global data, indicating its role in the data context."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The User interacts with EPG_Legal in the context of legal entity selection, indicating a direct relationship between them in the system's interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User interacts with EPG_Legal through the selection process in the system interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selects EPG_Legal from the dropdown menu for entity selection, linking the organization to user actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"User can change the Entity Selector from EPG_Legal to a local entity, adjusting the data view accordingly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user can select EPG_Legal from the Entity selector, indicating a direct choice made during data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user's choice of the EPG_Legal entity impacts their access rights, leading to the reported issues with report presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selects EPG_Legal from the entity dropdown, indicating their choice of organization in the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User may need to change their selection from EPG_Legal to their Local Entity in order to access the appropriate data presentations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user chooses the EPG_Legal entity from the entity selector to manage or view data related to this global entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User's choices in the system are related to EPG_Legal, showing a connection to organizational data selection."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User interacts with EPG_Legal by selecting it or changing to a local entity for data access."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user’s challenges stem from the selection of EPG_Legal in the system, highlighting user decision-making in the interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"User interacts with EPG_Legal by selecting it or changing it to a local entity in the dashboard to manage data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"User selects EPG_Legal from the entity dropdown to navigate the system, indicating a direct interaction with the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user interacts with EPG_Legal through the entity selector to manage their chosen global entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users based in EPG_Legal face limitations in accessing reports due to their local entity status."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User can select EPG_Legal from the dropdown, indicating the user’s interaction with this organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User selects EPG_Legal in the Entity Selector to address issues in data presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user changes the selection from EPG_Legal to a local entity to adjust data presentation."&lt;&lt;"entity selection, data adjustment"&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selects EPG_Legal from the entity selection, indicating a specific choice linked to local entity management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user selects EPG_Legal from the entity dropdown, linking their actions to the organization."&lt;/|&gt;"system interaction, organizational link"&lt;SEP&gt;"The User is involved in selecting EPG_Legal in a system, indicating their reliance on this organization for proper functioning of their tasks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user's selection of EPG_Legal affects their access to certain reports on OneStream, causing the 'No Access' error."&lt;SEP&gt;"User selects EPG_Legal or another entity from the entity selector to access related data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User may choose EPG_Legal as a global entity when using the dashboard to manage data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User has selected EPG_Legal from the dropdown, indicating their attempt to access specific organizational data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User selects EPG_Legal as an option in the dashboard to access specific data for decision-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user has selected EPG_Legal from the entity selection bar, indicating interaction with the organization regarding data selection issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User selects EPG_Legal in the entity dropdown, suggesting a connection between the User and this organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"User can select EPG_Legal from the dashboard, indicating a direct interaction between the User and the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User can select EPG_Legal within the entity selection bar, linking them to the organization in a legal context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User selected EPG_Legal within OneStream, impacting their ability to view the P&amp;L MPC Report."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user has chosen EPG_Legal from the entity selection bar, indicating a direct engagement with this organizational entity in the system."</data>
