  <data key="d3">221.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"EPG_Legal governs access to data related to Delivery Hero, suggesting a control and oversight relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal handles the selection of entities from Delivery Hero, influencing how data can be accessed by users."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is responsible for the legal selections that affect the access of users within Delivery Hero."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is responsible for the selection of entities within Delivery Hero and manages access rights for users, highlighting its role in data governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the selection process for Delivery Hero, affecting how data is accessed by users."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's selection process directly affects how users within Delivery Hero can access relevant data, indicating an organizational relationship regarding data protocols."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the access and selection process of entities associated with Delivery Hero, indicating a governing relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages access to Delivery Hero entities and presents them to central users, central to the data access issue."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is responsible for the selection of entities within Delivery Hero and controls data access based on user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the selection process for entities within Delivery Hero, controlling access to important data."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal operates as a selection system within the organizational framework of Delivery Hero, affecting data accessibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal operates within Delivery Hero's framework to manage data access and user classifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is responsible for handling selections related to Delivery Hero, influencing access to data."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is responsible for the selection process concerning the data related to Delivery Hero, indicating a governance role."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the selection of entities related to Delivery Hero, indicating a direct link between the two organizations regarding access permissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is responsible for presenting entities of Delivery Hero in the access selection process, indicating a functional relationship between the two organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal presents entities related to Delivery Hero, indicating a governance or selection role over user access to information."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the selection processes that involve entities of Delivery Hero, indicating a governing relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the selection process for Delivery Hero, impacting data access for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is associated with the legal selections of Delivery Hero, controlling who can access relevant data and information."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's selection process directly impacts the data access available to users of Delivery Hero, defining how users can interact with the data."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages access to entities of Delivery Hero, indicating a controlling relationship over data access."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the selection and access to data for entities of Delivery Hero, highlighting a regulatory relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is involved in the selection process and governance of data access for Delivery Hero, indicating a direct organizational relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the legal selection process for Delivery Hero's data access protocols."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's selection process directly affects the access of entities within Delivery Hero for central users and local users."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal operates in the context of Delivery Hero's entity selection process, affecting access permissions for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal operates within the operations of Delivery Hero, indicating its role in the legal aspects of the organization."</data>
