  <data key="d3">103.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Central users are able to access data managed by EPG_Legal, showing a direct relationship in data access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users are dependent on EPG_Legal for navigating access to Delivery Hero's entities."."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users are designated individuals who can access data via the EPG_Legal system, highlighting a tiered access structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users are granted access by EPG_Legal to manage the entities of Delivery Hero, highlighting a dependency relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users receive access to entities presented by EPG_Legal, impacting how data is managed within the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's selection process allows central users access to data, defining their role within Delivery Hero's data governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's selections grant access to central users, allowing them to view specific data pertaining to Delivery Hero."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal allows central users to access all entities related to Delivery Hero, indicating a direct access control relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal grants access rights to central users, regulating their ability to obtain relevant data."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal manages the access to relevant data that is only available to central users, indicating a control mechanism."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users have been granted access by EPG_Legal to the legal data pertaining to Delivery Hero."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users have the appropriate classifications to access data through EPG_Legal, establishing a functional role in data retrieval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Central users are granted access by EPG_Legal to the legal selection data, highlighting their privileged role."</data>
