<edge source="&quot;EPG_LEGAL&quot;" target="&quot;LOCAL USER&quot;">
  <data key="d3">99.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"EPG_Legal controls access to data, affecting local users' ability to retrieve relevant information."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal defines the classification that excludes local users from accessing relevant data from Delivery Hero."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal restricts access to local users, creating a separation between those with and without access rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal's structure prevents local users from accessing relevant data due to classification differences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users are denied access to data because they do not match EPG_Legal's classification criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users cannot access data through EPG_Legal, indicating a limitation in their user classification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users are relevant to EPG_Legal's selection process, as they are impacted by access restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users are categorized by EPG_Legal as not eligible to access relevant data, affecting their capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users are affected by the regulations set by EPG_Legal, which restrict their access to specific data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users are restricted by EPG_Legal's classification system, preventing them from accessing data."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local user is unable to access data from EPG_Legal due to classification restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users are affected by the access rules set by EPG_Legal, which restrict their data access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users do not match the access classification set by EPG_Legal, resulting in their inability to access relevant data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users lack the necessary classification to access data from EPG_Legal, illustrating a barrier to data retrieval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local users lack access to data from EPG_Legal, highlighting restrictions based on user classification."</data>
