  <data key="d4">"A user may select EPG_Legal in relation to their Local Entity, impacting the data displayed."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is an option users can select in relation to their Local Entity, impacting data retrieval based on user location."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is contrasted with a local entity in terms of user selection within a system interface."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is involved in the entity selection process that affects users based in local entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The issue arises when a user selects EPG_Legal instead of their local entity, affecting the functionality of the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local entity may choose EPG_Legal for legal-related functionalities in the system, indicating a reliance on the organization for legal matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Entity is contrasted with EPG_Legal, showcasing the difference between global and localized data selection."}&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal serves as a global entity that can be changed to a local entity based on user needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is mentioned as an option in the entity selection bar, suggesting a connection to local and global entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Entity is an alternative to EPG_Legal that users can choose from the dashboard for account management and access.""&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is selected by users within the entity dropdown, implying a connection to local entities that may not be displayed correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user is given the option to change from the EPG_Legal global entity to their chosen local entity for data management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Entity has chosen EPG_Legal as part of the entity selection process, indicating an organizational relationship in legal contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Users can switch from EPG_Legal to a Local Entity to access specific data tailored to their needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is referred to as an option in an entity selection process, indicating its role in user selection and entity management."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal serves as a reference point for users to select their local entity in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local entity relates to EPG_Legal as a different selection option within the entity dropdown menu, suggesting user distinction between them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local entity is selected as an alternative to global entities like EPG_Legal for organizational changes in data."&lt;&lt;"entity selection, data management"&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is mentioned as an example of a global entity that can be substituted with a Local Entity for data access."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is compared to a local entity, guiding users on how to configure their dashboard settings according to their operational needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is related to local entities as the user has to choose the correct organization from the selection bar to display relevant data."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is an organization that is associated with user selection, which indicates its operational relevance to users based in local entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Entity is an alternative to EPG_Legal, allowing users to select a more relevant organization for data purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is selected by users who are based in local entities, highlighting its function within local operations in contrast to central entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"EPG_Legal is a global option that can be changed to a local entity for specific user access in the dashboard."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local Entity serves as an alternative option to global entities like EPG_Legal for users in the navigation process of the dashboard."</data>
