min manages the account associated with EPG_Legal and ensures user access to the entity."."&lt;SEP&gt;"The local admin checks with EPG_Legal to ensure proper access for users."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Local Admin manages the assignment of user accounts to the global entity EPG_Legal, ensuring proper access."."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local admin helps users ensure their accounts are assigned to the correct global entity, EPG_Legal, in the dashboard."</data>
