 their ability to interact with the system correctly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User chooses a Local Entity when interacting with the system, indicating a direct involvement in the selection process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The user's selection of a local entity impacts their access to reports in OneStream, indicating a relationship between user location and access rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"The User is directly connected to the Local Entity they are associated with, affecting their experience in the system."&lt;SEP&gt;"User selects Local Entity from the Entity Selector to customize their data presentation according to their access rights."</data>
