  <data key="d4">"Local Entity can be selected through the Entity selector, allowing for tailored data presentations based on user needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Local entity is an option that can be selected through the Entity selector, providing access to relevant data for the user."&lt;SEP&gt;"The selection of a Local Entity is facilitated through the Entity Selector, which enables personalized data handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector enables the user to switch from a global entity to a local entity for data management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector is used to choose a local entity, emphasizing the process of selecting context-specific options."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity Selector enables the User to switch from a global entity like EPG_Legal to a Local Entity for tailored data results."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Entity selector allows changing selection from a global entity (like EPG_Legal) to a local entity."</data>
