  <data key="d4">"Error messages highlight problems with specific source data items, emphasizing the need for mapping and validation in OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Message directly relates to Source Data indicating unresolved items that need attention within OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error message highlights issues with the source data being incompatible with OneStream's data model requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error message is triggered when the source data contains values that are not recognized by OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error message provides feedback on issues with the source data during the import process, guiding corrections."."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error message generated indicates issues with the source data being imported into OneStream, highlighting the importance of data validity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Message indicates issues with Source Data that do not match recognized formats in OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"The error message pertains to issues encountered with the source data during its import into OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unrecognized Source Data can result in an Error Message indicating issues with data integrity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Error Message is triggered when there is an issue with the Source Data being imported into OneStream, indicating inconsistencies or invalid entries."</data>
