  <data key="d4">"A router provides the necessary hardware for Wi-Fi to operate, enabling wireless internet connectivity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi connects devices to a router, allowing multiple devices to access the internet through the same connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi relies on the Router to transmit internet signals wirelessly to connected devices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi relies on a router to function, as the router provides the connection between the internet and the local device network."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Router facilitates Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing devices to connect wirelessly to the internet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi relies on Routers to provide wireless internet access, indicating a dependence between the two."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi connects devices to the Router, which provides internet access and routes data between the devices and the internet."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi requires a Router to provide internet access to devices, indicating dependency between these technologies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi relies on the Router to connect devices wirelessly to the internet, facilitating data transfer and communication."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi connects devices wirelessly to the Router, which facilitates internet access for those devices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Router facilitates the connection between devices and the Wi-Fi network, enabling internet access."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi technology connects devices to the internet through a router, enabling wireless communication."&lt;SEP&gt;"The quality of Wi-Fi is determined by the performance and placement of the router, which provides the wireless signal."&lt;SEP&gt;"Wi-Fi devices connect to the Router, enabling wireless access to the Internet."</data>
  <data key="d5">"connectivity, network architecture"&lt;SEP&gt;"connectivity, wireless technology"&lt;SEP&gt;"hardware, connectivity"&lt;SEP&gt;"network access, connectivity"&lt;SEP&gt;"network functionality, connection"&lt;SEP&gt;"network infrastructure, connectivity"&lt;SEP&gt;"network infrastructure, dependency"&lt;SEP&gt;"networking, connectivity"&lt;SEP&gt;"technology relationship, connectivity"&lt;SEP&gt;"wireless connection, data transmission"&lt;SEP&gt;"wireless connection, infrastructure"&lt;SEP&gt;"wireless connection, internet access"</data>
