<edge source="&quot;ROOT CAUSE&quot;" target="&quot;TRANSFORMATION RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d3">42.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Identifying the Root Cause involves understanding how Transformation Rules influence data mapping and validation outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Root Cause is linked to Transformation Rules as it refers to the validation failures that occur due to inadequate mapping of source values.")&lt;SEP&gt;"The Root Cause of validation failures can be attributed to the inadequacy of Transformation Rules in covering all possible source values."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Root Cause is often tied to failures in the Transformation Rules, as inconsistencies in data can lead to validation failures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Transformation Rules are designed to identify and address the Root Cause of data mapping issues."</data>
