<edge source="&quot;SAP&quot;" target="&quot;DYNAMICS&quot;">
  <data key="d3">52.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Both SAP and Dynamics are involved in enterprise solutions, and inconsistencies between them may lead to validation failures in integrated workflows."&lt;SEP&gt;"SAP and Dynamics are both ERP systems, and their data mapping could involve similar validation rules for financial data.")&lt;SEP&gt;"SAP and Dynamics may contain differing formats or account information that can cause issues in data mapping when used with OneStream."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both SAP and Dynamics provide solutions that require mapping between different systems to ensure consistency in data format and integrity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Both SAP and Dynamics are source systems that feed data into OneStream, indicating their role in the financial mapping process."&lt;SEP&gt;"SAP and Dynamics are both enterprise systems that need to reconcile data to prevent validation failures in accounting processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"SAP and Dynamics are both enterprise solutions that companies may use, necessitating proper mapping for consistent data."&lt;SEP&gt;"SAP and Dynamics are both ERP systems, and discrepancies between them can lead to validation issues when integrating with OneStream."</data>
  <data key="d5">"ERP systems, validation issues"&lt;SEP&gt;"ERP systems, validation"&lt;SEP&gt;"data compatibility, potential conflict"&lt;SEP&gt;"enterprise solutions, data consistency"&lt;SEP&gt;"enterprise solutions, integration challenge"&lt;SEP&gt;"source systems, data flow"&lt;SEP&gt;"system integration, data consistency"&lt;SEP&gt;"system integration, data reconciliation"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7c686046d60abc94ecd48dc9fcb9279e</data>
</edge>
